Name: libarchive
URL: https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive
Version: 3.8.9
License: Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, CC0-1.0
License File: COPYING, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, LICENSE-APACHE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Pinned upstream release archive, unmodified. Build-time local change: validate
stored RAR3 data CRC before libarchive's generic EOF shortcut (build_archive.py).
Regression test corrupts stored data while retaining the declared CRC. SHA-256 of libarchive-3.8.9.tar.xz:
888c934f9d95648ecb9163dc8e23ab80a476ecb81a8f1154704a227b5b676dde
Only the RAR and RAR5 readers are registered. Optional external libraries,
external filter programs, disk extraction, tools and tests are not enabled by
our build/adapter. BLAKE2 is used under its CC0 alternative. Source file headers
remain controlling. Build scripts inside the source distribution retain their
own (open source) terms and are not linked into the product.
